    "I think we should ship this week and deal with the remaining issues later. What do you think?": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Creo que deberíamos lanzarlo esta semana y resolver lo que falte después. ¿Qué opinas?"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je pense qu'on devrait livrer cette semaine et régler les problèmes restants plus tard. Tu en penses quoi ?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ich finde, wir sollten diese Woche veröffentlichen und die restlichen Probleme später lösen. Was meinst du?"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Penso che dovremmo rilasciare questa settimana e sistemare dopo i problemi rimasti. Tu cosa ne pensi?"
